    "notes": "Roles follow lua/kanagawa/themes.lua: ui.bg for paper, bg_dim for canvas, bg_p1 for inset/hover, bg_p2 for active rows, original foreground and function blue for accent. Editor selection reproduces ui.bg_visual at Typie's fixed 30% alpha (Lotus differs by one blue-channel step after sRGB clipping). Search/comments deliberately keep Typie's amber family rather than the original blue search color; review issue/strength use violet/aqua. Additional editor hues follow source chroma with ordered hue positions."
  },
